---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../../../components/Icon.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="RTI Act (Section 4) - About Us | JKSPDC Official Portal" 
  description="Right to Information Act disclosures under Section 4 by Jammu & Kashmir State Power Development Corporation Limited (JKSPDCL)."
>
  <div class="space-y-0 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Premium Page Header Band -->
    <div class="page-header-band animate-fadeInUp">
      <nav class="breadcrumb-trail" aria-label="Breadcrumbs">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span class="separator">/</span>
        <span>RTI</span>
        <span class="separator">/</span>
        <span class="current">RTI Act (Sec 4)</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>RTI — Right to Information Act (Section 4)</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">Jammu &amp; Kashmir State Power Development Corporation Limited (JKSPDCL)</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="animate-fadeInUp delay-200 mt-6">
      <article class="space-y-6 text-left w-full">

        <!-- Overview Section -->
        <section class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-xs space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] border-b border-slate-100 pb-2.5">
            Overview
          </h2>
          <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            The Right to Information Act, 2005 is a move to replace a culture of secrecy and control in Public Authorities with one of openness, transparency and participation. The Act also proposes to strengthen the democratic set up of our country by providing its citizen's, access to Information in Public Authorities covering the Executive, Judiciary and Legislature arms.
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Chenab Valley Power Projects [P] Ltd., being a Joint Venture of NHPC Limited (A Govt. of India Enterprise) and JKSPDC (A Govt. of J&amp;K Enterprise) has taken concrete actions to provide Information to the citizens of the country in accordance with the Act. This section of CVPPPL's official website along with other relevant sections contains Information as required to be published under Section 4 of the Act.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Acts & Rules Section -->
        <section class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-xs space-y-5">
          <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] border-b border-slate-100 pb-2.5">
            Acts &amp; Rules
          </h2>

          <!-- Right to Information Act, 2005 -->
          <div class="border-b border-slate-100 pb-4">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800">Right to Information Act, 2005</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Right to Information Rules, 2012 -->
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800">Right to Information Rules, 2012</p>
            <div>
              <a 
                href="/rti_jkspdcl.pdf" 
                target="_blank" 
                rel="noopener noreferrer" 
                class="btn-primary text-xs inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer"
              >
                <Icon name="file-text" size={13} />
                <span>View Attachment &raquo;</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

